<h2>Upgrading from a Ryzen 5 5600: 5700X3D or 5800X3D?</h2>
<p>For a Ryzen 5 5600 or 5600X owner, a 3D V-Cache chip is the biggest gaming upgrade AM4 offers. The table shows how much of a modern graphics card each CPU can use at 1080p, where the CPU matters most.</p>
